LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

Project Planning Phase

1. Introduction

The Project Planning Phase defines how the LegalEase project will be developed, tested, documented, and demonstrated. It converts the requirements and system design into an organized development plan.

LegalEase is an AI-powered web application designed to help users create structured legal document drafts by entering simple information and selecting the required document type.

The planning phase focuses on objectives, tasks, resources, timeline, technology, team responsibilities, risks, and expected outcomes.


---

2. Project Goal

The main goal of LegalEase is to develop a simple and user-friendly application that can:

Allow users to select a document type.

Collect required information through forms.

Use AI to generate a structured draft.

Allow users to preview and edit the draft.

Generate downloadable documents.

Provide appropriate legal-use disclaimers.

Protect user information and application credentials.



---

3. Project Objectives

The project will aim to:

1. Develop an easy-to-use web interface.


2. Implement different document templates/categories.


3. Integrate an AI model for document drafting.


4. Validate user-provided information.


5. Generate properly structured drafts.


6. Provide preview and editing functionality.


7. Enable document export.


8. Implement basic security measures.


9. Test the system for functionality and usability.


10. Prepare complete project documentation and demonstration.




